=== Stress ===
Words ending with a vowel or ''s'', as well as verb forms ending with ''n'', have stress on the penultimate syllable. Words ending with a diphthong or a consonant (except ''s'' but including ''n'') have stress on the last syllable. Exceptions have marked stress.<ref name = Easy/>

Examples are:

''La mecan<u>i</u>ca''; destri<u>a</u>r; cu<u>é</u>lher; c<u>a</u>ntan; pen<u>ó</u>s; gat<u>o</u>n.

== Grammar == 
The following section describes the grammar of the [[Languedocien dialect|Languedocian dialect]] which is central geographically and most conservative among Occitan dialects.<ref name = Languedoc /> For that reason it serves as a basis for standardization of Occitan.<ref name = Standard/> 

